            <td>Learning to Work with Legacy Media and <br />
            Forensic Imaging</td>
            <td>TBA November 2025</td>
            <td>In-Person</td>
          </tr>
        </mj-table>

        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="18px" font-family="Roboto" padding-top="16px">
          <br /><br />
          Key Highlights
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Highlight 1 -->
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" padding-top="16px">September Mastering Metadata was a Success!</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto">
          We want to extend a sincere thanks to everyone who came to our September Mastering Metadata workshop. We have received your requests for another edition of this workshop, as well as a continued advanced version. We will promptly notify you once these options become available. 
          <br /><br />
          If you are interested in hearing more about this past workshop, please do not hesitate to reach out to us at <a href="mailto:digitalpreservation@soton.ac.uk">digitalpreservation@soton.ac.uk</a>.
          <br /><br />
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Highlight 2 -->
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" padding-top="16px">Quick Poll Time</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto">
          We want to hear your input on our upcoming events and workshops. Please take a moment to answer this quick anonymous poll to let us know what you would like to see from us in these upcoming months. 
